{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30586","headline":"和主司王起 · 刘耕","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孔门频建铸颜功，紫绶青衿感激同。\n一篑勤劳成太华，三年恩德仰维嵩。\n杨随前辈穿皆中，桂许平人折欲空。\n惭和周郎应见顾，感知大造竟无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘耕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}